    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it just feels like some of these border processes are so unnecessarily complicated and almost arbitrary. it's like they want to catch you in a mistake just to make things difficult for the sake of it. do you have any advice on how to deal with the \"human element\" of this? like when an officer is being difficult or there's just some weird, unwritten rule happening at the gate?",
